{"4333480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aleeda", "steam_appid": 4333480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Introductory Souls-Like</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to play and understand the beloved souls-like game-play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These bosses have been crafted to challenge the player in every way possible. But. THEY. DON'T. LOSE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against perfect being that will defeat you NO MATTER WHAT. There is a small right now where the bosses heath gets reduced to 0 if you hit them enough, our helper in game will make sure to fix anything if that issue occurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out different weapons, spells, and full builds to try and defeat the absolute wall that the bosses are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against adaptive bosses that get stronger the more you kill them. With each death the boss learns and adapts to your play style.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Adaptive bosses that evolve with every kill.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Full stat reconfiguration to try new builds.</u></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Introductory Souls-Like</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to play and understand the beloved souls-like game-play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These bosses have been crafted to challenge the player in every way possible. But. THEY. DON'T. LOSE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against perfect being that will defeat you NO MATTER WHAT. There is a small right now where the bosses heath gets reduced to 0 if you hit them enough, our helper in game will make sure to fix anything if that issue occurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out different weapons, spells, and full builds to try and defeat the absolute wall that the bosses are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against adaptive bosses that get stronger the more you kill them. With each death the boss learns and adapts to your play style.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Adaptive bosses that evolve with every kill.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Full stat reconfiguration to try new builds.</u></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Fight against the Ultimate boss that was created to perfection. Flip the usual souls-like narrative. You are stuck at your strongest, while the bosses have learned to evolve and understand how you think. The bosses are here for revenge, and they will not die till they take you down with them.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333480/5818b78a4ce861e801b6267559b74bbdc2f8dd5d/header.jpg?t=1783209162", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333480/c67fe67510e712b369ef4eda0b512e45f615285c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783209162", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333480/c67fe67510e712b369ef4eda0b512e45f615285c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783209162", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8GHz Dual-Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class